## Goal

Each Legacy card (`traininggrounds-041`–`060`) draws its own picture on both faces: the set's yard under its Core card's subject, kept where the Core picture puts it, plus a practice-yard touch no other Legacy card has. Radiant only gilds and adds rays; a fixture proves every Core and other Training Grounds picture unchanged; with ruling R2724000, a `--visual` fragment and a pixel spec. The planner prototyped all of it on this base: tests, typecheck, eslint and `typecheck:component` passed, and the pixel spec failed on today's code, as it must.

