3. **`traininggrounds.ts`, same-output refactors.** Add `import { artSpec, type ArtSpec, type SkyScheme } from "./procedural.ts";` and `compositionFor`, `themeFor` to the `./themes.ts` import. `type Paint` → `export type Paint`. `backdrop`'s third parameter becomes `night: boolean` (delete its `const night = …` line). Under `// The document` add `const VIGNETTE =` and `const SVG_OPEN =`, holding verbatim the `<radialGradient id="v" …>` string `trainingGroundsSvg` pushes and its `<svg viewBox=…>` opening; there use `defs.push(VIGNETTE)`, `SVG_OPEN +` and `backdrop(behind, p, FAMILY_PAINTS[subject.family].sky === NIGHT_SKY, defs)`. Reword the header, `SNAPSHOT_ART` and `snapshotArtOf` comments: Legacy cards draw their Core card's subject in the yard with a touch of their own (R2724000, `legacySvg`).

