8. **Spec.** `spec/rulings/R2724000.md`, front matter: `id: R2724000`, `title: "Each Training Grounds Legacy card draws its Core card's subject in the set's yard, with a touch of its own (issue #2724; amends R2202000 and R2511000)"`, `cards: "R503, R2202000, R2511000, R2529000, TG #41–#60"`, `proven_in: [apps/web/src/cards/art/traininggrounds.test.tsx]` (as a YAML list). Body:
